            <note corresp="#d234-f2" n="1" xml:id="d234-f2-content">
                <p>The Department of State transmitted to the Embassy in Amman in telegram 504, May
                    2, the terms of reference for the tripartite military advisory team that would
                    be headed by a Brigadier General. Telegram 504 and additional documentation
                    relating to the mission are in Department of State, Central File DEF 19 US.</p>
            </note>
